Name: mcp
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-24
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Model Context Protocol Server for GNU Octave
Description: A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes GNU Octave to
 any MCP-capable assistant.  The server process is an Octave interpreter, so
 the interpreter answering a question is the interpreter being asked about,
 with the same load path, the same installed packages and the same version.
 Provides read-only introspection of functions, classes, namespaces and
 installed packages.
Categories: Miscellaneous
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0)
Url: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/octave-mcp
Tracker: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/octave-mcp/issues
